<title>UK: Northern Rock sets 50 mln stg structured bond.</title>
<headline>Northern Rock sets 50 mln stg structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORTHERN ROCK BUIDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    50 MLN STG    BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY  **11.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE   FRN/FIXED     MARGIN    *+47 BP    PAY DATE</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2 BP	ISS PRICE  PAR	 REOFFER     PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE AND THEN 8.25 PCT.</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE AT PAR ON 13.JUL.98.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
